Certainly; it's been on our site as part of the tournament patch for a 
month or so.  ;-)

(I can provide the grue-only patch by email, if you'd prefer; we build 
the tournament patch by merging several others and each Challenge is 
actually a separate patch.)

The grue patch is very closely based on the grues in Zork, though, and 
most of the suggestion would be inconsistent with that; there's _only 
one_ defense against them in Zork.  ;-)

(Actually, I'm kind of surprised not to have sen Zork mentioned here yet.)

The action counter was chosen based on my memory of Zork, which is not 
entirely reliable, but I think doing _anything_ (including checking your 
inventory) decremented the counter there.

